    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maqa worra lafa iti boojiani keesaa gale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami boojiani hedduuni lafa Babiloniti kae, Yerusalemufi Yuda d'aqe, namu dira ufiti gale. Worri isaani haguma duri Nebukadrezani worra boojieti lafuma Babiloni jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaaroleeni worraa gugurdoni tana: Zerubabeli, Yoshua, Nehemia, Seraya, Reelaya, Mordekai, Bilshani, Mispar-Bigwai, Rehumu, Baana. Kunini maqa balbala gosa Israelitiifi henna nama boojiani, ka eege lafa ufiti gale:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.55+EZR.2.56+EZR.2.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.55",
              "EZR.2.56",
              "EZR.2.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami balbala worra Mana Waaqa eegutifi ka hojattu Solomoni, ka achii gale, wolti nama 392. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle nama 652 ka balbala Delaiyafi Tobiafi Nekoda, ka dira Tel-mela, Tel-Harsha, Kerubu, Adani, Imeri keesaa galeti jira; ammo worri aka Israeli keesaa d'alate ufi beesisu dad'abe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.59+EZR.2.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.59",
              "EZR.2.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri balbala qaalole, ka aka balbala Suni keesaa d'alate ufi beesisu dad'abe kana: Habaya, Hakosi, Barzilai. (Namichi toko ka d'aloota balbala qaalole, ta Barzilai jed'ani, dubra Barzilai, worra Gileadi, fuud'e, balbala sodda isaa himate.) Waan worri aka balbala qaalole keesaa d'alate, ufi beesisu dad'abeefi, qaalole tahu d'owani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.61+EZR.2.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.61",
              "EZR.2.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 27.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Namichi guddaani Yahudi waan worraani jed'e, sagale Waaqaa baasani haga qaalluuni Urimufi Thumimuni wo himu d'ufuti inyaatina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.63"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
